# FlexPad language file: Officialese German (Amtsdeutsch) (de-x-amtsdt)
# Category: fun
# Generated by Claude (AI) and reviewed.
# Please report mistakes or better wording as an issue: https://github.com/TripleT3005/FlexPad/issues
# Reviewed by: @TripleT3005
#
# Format: key = text. Keep the keys and placeholders such as {name} unchanged.
# Missing texts are taken from the fallback language, otherwise from English.

